sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Owner
    participant A as Old instance
    participant N as New instance
    participant D as DNS and identity
    participant C as Clients
    O->>N: Provision target with OpenTofu, same BOTHY_VERSION
    O->>N: Import secrets bundle (same instance_id, pepper, signing key, push key)
    O->>N: Trial run: restore the latest backup, checks green
    O->>D: Lower DNS TTL in advance
    O->>A: Maintenance mode read_only, ADR 0065 (status page: maintenance)
    A-->>C: Writes return 503 maintenance, outbox waits
    O->>A: Final backup (pg_dump, objects, manifest)
    O->>N: Restore the final backup, compare manifest
    O->>N: Repeat emergency revocations since the final backup
    O->>D: Switch DNS, check OIDC redirect URIs
    C->>N: Reconnect with the same cursor (same timeline, no resync)
    N-->>C: Catch-up, then send outbox
    O->>A: Shut down after the deadline and delete data securely
